# Documentation as Source of Truth

All decisions about platform components MUST be validated against official documentation. Do NOT rely on training data or assumptions — fetch and verify.

## Source Priority (highest to lowest)

1. **Red Hat Official Documentation** — GA status, supported configs, operator setup
2. **Upstream project documentation** — API reference, CRD fields, feature details
3. **Upstream source code** — conflict resolution, CRD source of truth

